cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Intro to Scaled Qualitative Analysis"
message: "If you use this teaching material, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abramson
    given-names: Corey M.
    affiliation: Rice University
repository-code: "https://github.com/Corey-Abramson/Intro-to-Scaled-Qualitative-Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A single plug-and-play notebook demonstrating a scaled qualitative analysis
  workflow end to end on public interview data: normalization of raw text into
  machine-readable rows, reading a coded corpus, three lanes of classification
  (dictionary, machine learning, large language model), and visualization.
  Built for the Stanford / CASBS AIMS session on qualitative and textual data.
  Code is BSD 3-Clause; the bundled corpus is not, and retains its own use
  restriction.
keywords:
  - qualitative analysis
  - computational social science
  - qualitative coding
  - text analysis
  - ethnography
  - large language models
  - teaching materials
